sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor L as Librarian (Clerk/Admin)
    participant B as React Client
    participant A as Express API
    participant D as Data Store

    L->>B: Search book & select student
    B->>A: POST /api/library/issues
    A->>D: Check availableCopies > 0
    D-->>A: Book available
    A->>D: insertOne(bookIssues) + decrement copies
    D-->>A: Issue record (dueDate = +14 days)
    A-->>B: 201 {issue}
    B-->>L: Confirmation with due date

    Note over A,D: Daily: overdue = today > dueDate,<br/>fine accrues per day late

    L->>B: Process return
    B->>A: POST /api/library/issues/:id/return
    A->>D: Read issue record
    D-->>A: Issue with dueDate
    A->>A: fine = daysLate x finePerDay
    A->>D: Update issue (returned, fine)
    A->>D: increment availableCopies
    alt Fine > 0
        A->>D: insertOne(dailyAccounts, fine income)
    end
    A-->>B: 200 {returned, fine}
    B-->>L: Show fine collected
